---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="House of Glitter — Verhaal">
  <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Verhaal</h1>
  <div class="hog-card max-w-2xl font-body">
    <p class="text-hog-text/90">Every great house has a crest — so we made one of our own.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-hog-text/90">
      At the center sits the disco ball: our world in miniature, spinning light in
      every direction, because that's exactly what this project is about. The
      crossed microphones stand guard on either side, our own golden lions, always
      ready to perform. Above it all, a crown — not for royalty, but for the
      confidence to own who you are.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-hog-text/90">
      The rainbow arching overhead is our promise: there's room here for every
      color, every sound, every version of yourself. And underneath it all, our
      motto says everything you need to know about how we live:
      <strong class="text-hog-gold">To Glitter or Die</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
